        "answer": {
          "id": 1,
          "status": "answered",
          "body": "To complete the Python Programming course, submit all four graded labs, achieve at least 70% overall, and earn a Pass on the capstone project. The capstone resubmission is available once after written feedback, and completion is recorded in the LMS Results area after verification by the course coordinator.",
